<%# Only the prompt is quoted in a bubble. The answer is the page speaking, so
    it takes the full column with nothing around it.

    A prompt with pictures in it keeps them inside the bubble: they were sent
    as one message, so they stay one shape on the page. The text is drawn only
    when there is text — a picture on its own is a whole message. -%>
<% pictures = Array(images) -%>
<% if role == "user" -%>
<div class="msg user<%= pictures.empty? ? "" : " has-attachments" %>">
  <div class="bubble<%= pictures.empty? ? "" : " has-attachments" %>">
    <span class="sr-only">Kamu: </span>
    <% unless text.to_s.strip.empty? -%>
    <span class="bubble-text"><%= h(text) %></span>
    <% end -%>
    <%= View.render("_attachments", images: pictures) unless pictures.empty? %>
  </div>
</div>
<% else -%>
<div class="text"><span class="sr-only">Rubot: </span><%= fmt(text) %></div>
<% end -%>
